      "parent_block_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "Formed in 2013 to source and manage investments for our founder’s capital. Expanded to offer investors to unique investments encompassing both a perpetual portfolio of seasoned assets, as as single investment sidecar opportunities. Focus on income producing commercial real estate assets unique or opportunistic development projects. Investments span the capital - senior debt - mezzanine debt - preferred equity - limited partner and JV equity",
