        "native_text": "Formed in 2013 to source and\nmanage investments for our\nfounder’s capital.\nExpanded to offer investors\nto unique investments\nencompassing both a perpetual\nportfolio of seasoned assets, as\nas single investment sidecar\nopportunities.\nFocus on income producing\ncommercial real estate assets\nunique or opportunistic\ndevelopment projects.\nInvestments span the capital\n- senior debt\n- mezzanine debt\n- preferred equity\n- limited partner and JV equity",
